https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness

RAGE — Relational Attack Graph Exchange
https://rage.fail/
Normative format reference: https://rage.fail/format

The exchange adapter implements the documented RAGE v0.1 NDJSON format and
credits the TrustedSec RAGE project and its contributors.
Upstream repository: https://github.com/trustedsec/RAGE The RAGE website identifies
its specification as Apache-2.0. No RAGE implementation, schemas, taxonomy,
derivation rules, datasets, logos, or source files are redistributed here.
Assessment-specific types and operational records are this plugin's extensions.
The plugin is not an official RAGE product and implies no endorsement.

ProjectDiscovery
https://projectdiscovery.io/
https://github.com/projectdiscovery

Automatic recon ingestion consumes normalized output from the existing Harness
ProjectDiscovery adapters (Subfinder, URLfinder, DNSx, HTTPx, Naabu, and Katana).
This package does not bundle these executables. Their upstream licenses and
attribution remain with their separately installed distributions.

